ngs**, from a `rm -rf target` clean build.\n- **Symbol diff empty**: `nm -D --defined-only` on both `.so`s → identical 10-symbol lists.\n- **Differential testing via a `dlopen` driver** exercising every exported function (edge values incl. `INT_MIN`/`INT_MAX`, NULL pointers, negative/oversized counts, out-of-range opcodes, uninitialized-then-`init_state` structs, plus 300–400 xorshift-random rounds):\n  - 92,945 bytes — identical\n  - 473,679 bytes (fuzz) — identical\n  - 275,390 bytes (final clean-build run) — **byte-identical**, matching exit codes, empty stderr\n- **Function-pointer identity**: `get_operation(0..3)` returns addresses that `dlsym`-compare equal to the exported `multiply_with_static`/`add_with_static`/`xor_operation`/`shift_with_static` symbols, and NULL outside `0..3` — same as C.\n\nNote: Cargo forbids hyphens in lib target names, so the artifact is `libharvest_work_QXiPV2.so` (underscore-normalized form of the C `libharvest-work-QXiPV2.so`). Nothing in `c_src/` was modified (mtimes unchanged)."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":945,"cache_read_input_tokens":46030,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":945,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7609d4fc-847a-4c27-9508-588be430dc21","uuid":"0a97d192-b895-4b33-a162-8fd74ae446fe","timestamp":"2026-08-27T23:03:59.197Z"}
